    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 31 ('Sweetwater Climb (the live dungeon: rebel bixies up the climb past their nectar '): scene wc_sweetwater_climb, 6 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Rebel Mage Pollentine last; every spot is the fork's."
